========================================================================


  D = S + M where:
  S = total self-loop orbits across all classes
  M = total edge multiplicity excess = sum_{edges} (mult_i + mult_j - 2)

  S sequence: 2, 6, 16 (from S185 data)
  M = D - S: 0, 0, 12

